   "notes": "Final figures from the 'Cuadro complementario' (p.4): TOTAL GENERAL = 22 November votes + complementary election of 14 March 1926 ordered by the Tribunal Calificador; proclamation 23 Apr 1926 (as printed). The provisional 22 November scrutiny is on p.3 (Lista 3 1,309; Lista 5 6,403; Lista 6 1,717; Lista 8 1,478; Lista 10 1,786; presumptive elected Hidalgo, Alessandri, Poblete, Núñez Morgado, Cabero). registered = sum of province inscritos in header (Tarapacá 8,606; Antofagasta 13,613; handwritten total 22,219). blank = 'En blanco' 11; 'Sin escrutar' 3 not recorded in a field. No cast/valid printed. Lista 10: TOTAL GENERAL prints the list sum as 1,072, but the cuociente table prints 1,972 and the rows (56+1,813+24+35+8+36) give 1,972; recorded 1,972. Its no-preference (56), Cabero (1,813) and Viel (24) cells in TOTAL GENERAL are blurred; taken as the sum of the two province TOTAL cells (3+53, 2+1,811, 0+24), and Cabero's 1,813 is confirmed by the text. Seats: Lista 5 three (Hidalgo, Alessandri, Viel by relative majority), Lista 6 one, Lista 10 one."
